Way":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":1111101,"initDialog":111110101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[10343],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/LQ/Hutao1_11111/Q1111101","priority":5,"questId":11111,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":111110101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1021,"speakerName":"胡桃","textMapHash":62241522,"text":"孟、帰ったよ！残念だけど、狼兄貴は見つからなかった。","nextNodeIds":[111110102]},{"nodeId":111110102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10343,"speakerName":"孟","textMapHash":1351297082,"text":"そうですか、困りましたね。探せるところはもう探したはずなのに…","nextNodeIds":[111110103]},{"nodeId":111110103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4200812970,"text":"狼兄貴って一体誰なんだ？","nextNodeIds":[111110104]},{"nodeId":111110104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10343,"speakerName":"孟","textMapHash":228245546,"text":"そうだな、一から説明しよう。俺の実家は無妄の丘の近くにあってな、小さい頃から仲の良い幼馴染が数人いたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[111110105]},{"nodeId":111110105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10343,"speakerName":"孟","textMapHash":2296518322,"text":"その中の一人が狼兄貴、特に俺と仲がよくていつも遊んでいた。けど、ある日突然、不慮の事故で亡くなったんだよ。","nextNodeIds":[111110106]},{"nodeId":111110106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10343,"speakerName":"孟","textMapHash":2232802962,"text":"そのことがずっと忘れられなくてな。今も時々、俺は無妄の丘に足を運ぶんだ。","nextNodeIds":[111110107]},{"nodeId":111110107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10343,"speakerName":"孟","textMapHash":3642236474,"text":"だがこの前、無妄の丘から戻ってくると体に違和感を感じたんだ。そして毎晩、夢の中に狼兄貴が現れるようになった。","nextNodeIds":[111110108]},{"nodeId":111110108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10343,"speakerName":"孟","textMapHash":751771074,"text":"それで思ったんだ。もしかしたら、本当に狼兄貴が何かをしているんじゃないかって。","nextNodeIds":[111110109,111110110]},{"nodeId":111110109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4088774146,"text":"奇妙な話だ。","nextNodeIds":[111110111]},{"nodeId":111110111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10343,"speakerName":"孟","textMapHash":25497602,"text":"ただの予想だし証拠はないが、どうにも落ち着かない。考えれば考えるほど不安が募る。","nextNodeIds":[111110112]},{"nodeId":111110112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10343,"speakerName":"孟","textMapHash":3501512802,"text":"幼馴染の友達がもし悪鬼にでもなっていたら、そんなのどう受け止めればいいんだ？","nextNodeIds":[111110113]},{"nodeId":111110113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1021,"speakerName":"胡桃","textMapHash":3966956506,"text":"彼はそれが原因で往生堂に入ったの。だから、このことに関しては給料も受け取ってない。","nextNodeIds":[111110114]},{"nodeId":111110114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1021,"speakerName":"胡桃","textMapHash":36105530,"text":"でも、孟の心配が的中する可能性はあるの。だって、鬼の霊が現世を彷徨うことは時々あるからね。","nextNodeIds":[111110115]},{"nodeId":111110115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1021,"speakerName":"胡桃","textMapHash":1778017930,"text":"でも悪鬼は言い過ぎかな。私ですらめったに悪鬼なんて見ないもの。","nextNodeIds":[111110116]},{"nodeId":111110116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10343,"speakerName":"孟","textMapHash":929280370,"text":"けど、狼兄貴の危険性を否定する材料にはなりません。あいつが誰かを傷つける姿を、俺は見たくないんです。","nextNodeIds":[111110117]},{"nodeId":111110117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1021,"speakerName":"胡桃","textMapHash":2037999122,"text":"まあ、こんな感じ。狼兄貴が見つかるまで、孟は仕事に身が入らないの。","nextNodeIds":[111110118]},{"nodeId":111110118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1021,"speakerName":"胡桃","textMapHash":2636468058,"text":"さっき私たちが訪ねたあの人たちも、その数人いる孟の幼馴染でね。狼兄貴がその中に潜んでるんじゃないかって睨んでたんだけど、ハズレだったみたい。","nextNodeIds":[111110119]},{"nodeId":111110119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10343,"speakerName":"孟","textMapHash":1334368442,"text":"無妄の丘を探し、あいつらのところも探した、これで手がかりが全て途絶えた…","nextNodeIds":[111110120]},{"nodeId":111110120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10345,"speakerName":"洛成","textMapHash":246710834,"text":"ごめんください、往生堂の方ですか？","nextNodeIds":[111110121]},{"nodeId":111110121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10345,"speakerName":"洛成","textMapHash":458183970,"text":"僕は洛成と言います。最近具合が悪くて、何かにまとわりつかれてる気がするんです。","nextNodeIds":[111110122]},{"nodeId":111110122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10345,"speakerName":"洛成","textMapHash":2620626626,"text":"先日、友達と無妄の丘で肝試しを行ったんですが、帰ったあとに倒れてしまって、それからは毎晩悪夢を見るように。医者に診てもらいましたが、原因は何も分からずじまいでして。","nextNodeIds":[111110123]},{"nodeId":111110123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10345,"speakerName":"洛成","textMapHash":2506564402,"text":"僕、きっと呪われたんです！魔神に！","nextNodeIds":[111110124]},{"nodeId":111110124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1021,"speakerName":"胡桃","textMapHash":1187914050,"text":"うん、そうですね、あたり、魔神に呪われてます。それもやばいくらいに。","nextNodeIds":[111110125]},{"nodeId":111110125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10345,"speakerName":"洛成","textMapHash":4267655922,"text":"あなたも知ってますよね！魔神戦争で死んだ伝説の魔神が、この世に苦痛をもたらす呪いをかけたっていう。","nextNodeIds":[111110126]},{"nodeId":111110126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10345,"speakerName":"洛成","textMapHash":805971690,"text":"この呪いを解かないと、五臓六腑がはじけ飛んで、凄惨な死を遂げるとかなんとか！","nextNodeIds":[111110127]},{"nodeId":111110127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10345,"speakerName":"洛成","textMapHash":3818832602,"text":"伝説にあった呪いの症状と、今の僕は同じなんです！","nextNodeIds":[111110128]},{"nodeId":111110128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10343,"speakerName":"孟","textMapHash":102630514,"text":"無妄の丘、呪い…いや、これは呪いじゃなく、たぶん狼兄貴が…","nextNodeIds":[111110129]},{"nodeId":111110129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1021,"speakerName":"胡桃","textMapHash":1657596986,"text":"はぁ、待った待った。二人とも静かに、勝手にしゃべらないで。","nextNodeIds":[111110130]},{"nodeId":111110130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2333525586,"text":"おまえにだけは言われたくない。","nextNodeIds":[111110131]},{"nodeId":111110131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10345,"speakerName":"洛成","textMapHash":4104806890,"text":"往生堂はこういった鬼とか魔神のことに詳しいんですよね！助けてください！まだ死にたくありません！","nextNodeIds":[111110132]},{"nodeId":111110132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1021,"speakerName":"胡桃","textMapHash":4183813898,"text":"いいですよ、問題ありません、私に任せてください。","nextNodeIds":[111110133]},{"nodeId":111110133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1021,"speakerName":"胡桃","textMapHash":2769755930,"text":"でも呪いを解くにはそれに適した場が必要です、準備しないといけません。","nextNodeIds":[111110134]},{"nodeId":111110134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1021,"speakerName":"胡桃","textMapHash":3007217554,"text":"新入り、あなたの手が必要だから、私と一緒に来て。","nextNodeIds":[111110135]},{"nodeId":111110135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10343,"speakerName":"孟","textMapHash":1285452474,"text":"お、俺も一緒に…","nextNodeIds":[111110136]},{"nodeId":111110136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1021,"speakerName":"胡桃","textMapHash":3140594514,"text":"あなたはまず彼に焚香駆邪を行ってあげて、前に教えたはずだよ。","nextNodeIds":[111110137]},{"nodeId":111110137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1021,"speakerName":"胡桃","textMapHash":391571978,"text":"準備ができたら私のとこに来て。これが終わったらまた狼兄貴のことについて話そう。","nextNodeIds":[111110138]},{"nodeId":111110138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10343,"speakerName":"孟","textMapHash":3971154706,"text":"分かりました。","nextNodeIds":[111110139]},{"nodeId":111110139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1021,"speakerName":"胡桃","textMapHash":4096967298,"text":"じゃあ私たちは行きましょう。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":111110110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4030081850,"text":"そんなのありえないよね。","nextNodeIds":[111110111]}]},{"talkId":1111103,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"rando